  "_readme": [
    "Central asset manifest. Every image, video still, artifact, logo-adjacent card, and metric marker on the site resolves through this file.",
    "To replace a placeholder: drop the file into src/assets/<file> (images) or public/media/<file> (video), then set `file` (and `poster` for video) on the matching entry. No layout code changes are required.",
    "`permission` must be one of: pending | approved | redacted | private-only. Entries marked private-only are never rendered as real media even if a file is present.",
    "Aspect ratios are strings like 16:9. The placeholder renders at that ratio; a real file is cropped to it with object-fit: cover."
